    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d319-a2">

                <pb facs="0359" n="277" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg277"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister for Foreign Affairs to the American
                        Minister.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-05-08"><hi rendition="#italic">May 8,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Minister</hi>: In reply to your excellency’s
                    courteous note of the 4th instant, I have the honor to advise your excellency
                    that pursuant to your request proper instructions have been issued to the proper
                    authorities to permit American citizens who may be arrested in the Republic
                    immediately to apprise their competent consular representative of their
                    detention.</p>
                <p>I avail [etc.],</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Luis Toledo
                    Herrarte.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
